<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All my heart to Him I give,</l><l>Ever to Him I’ll cling,</l><l>In His blessed presence live,</l><l>Ever His praises sing.</l><l>Love so mighty and so true</l><l>Merits my soul’s best songs;</l><l>Faithful, loving service, too,</l><l>To Him belongs.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Souls in danger, look above,</l><l>Jesus completely saves;</l><l>He will lift you by His love</l><l>Out of the angry waves.</l><l>He’s the Master of the sea,</l><l>Billows His will obey;</l><l>He your Savior wants to be—</l><l>Be saved today.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
